{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18301","headline":"芍药歌 · 韩愈","name":"芍药歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丈人庭中开好花，更无凡木争春华。\n翠茎红蘂天力与，此恩不属黄锺家。\n温馨熟美鲜香起，似笑无言习君子。\n霜刀翦汝天女劳，何事低头学桃李。\n娇痴婢子无灵性，竞挽春衫来比并。\n欲将双颊一曦红，绿窗磨徧青铜镜。\n一尊春酒甘若饴，丈人此乐无人知。\n花前醉倒歌者谁，楚狂小子韩退之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}